# Extra wallpaper directories — one absolute path per line.
# Each listed directory is merged into the active theme's backgrounds as
# read-only symlinks (zz-user-<dirname>-<name>), so Noctalia's picker shows
# them alongside the theme's shipped wallpapers. Your files are never
# copied or deleted — only linked. Lines starting with ~/ are expanded;
# # comments and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Examples:
#   ~/Pictures/Wallpapers
#   /mnt/Photos/wallpapers
#   /mnt/nfs/wallpapers